WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:07.400
Every project's tasks on one board

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.900
A long project name doesn't fit — it is cut off

3
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.400
Open the Projects list

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.700
Touch and hold a project

5
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.500
Edit Project…

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.000
A short name — used where the full name doesn't fit

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.700
Save

8
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:34.500
Back to the board

9
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:44.100
Now the short name stands in where the full one doesn't fit
